        "&7The Ember Forge needs this path: its alloys come out of a mixer, a press, a fan, a blaze burner and mechanical crafters. The windmill, goggles, millstone, contraptions and deployers stay optional.",
        "",
        "Mix andesite with iron or zinc nuggets into &6Andesite Alloy&r: the bones of every machine to come.",
        "",
        "&o\"The old world ran on wheels and water. It ran right up until it didn't.\"&r"
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "h_clockwork/alloy/task0",
          "type": "advancement",
          "advancement": "create:andesite_alloy",
          "title": "lang:advancement.create.andesite_alloy"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
